WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.986
You've been kneeling there since sundown,
Salazar.

00:00:02.986 --> 00:00:04.986
Have I? I hadn't noticed.

00:00:04.986 --> 00:00:05.972
There's no name on that slab.

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:08.959
No, there isn't.

00:00:08.959 --> 00:00:11.946
Someone the world was rather keen to forget.

00:00:11.946 --> 00:00:13.946
Go back to the fire, Neera.
It's getting cold.

00:00:13.946 --> 00:00:14.932
That's not an answer.

00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:16.000
I know.
